sieve-filter-v1
; Punctuation for babel29 pages (SPACE, a-z, comma and full stop): a comma or a full stop
; follows a letter and is followed by a SPACE; full stops come up to three in a row ("..."),
; and a single one may be followed at once by a letter ("e.g."); no SPACE before either.
; Without it, a babel29 page is mostly commas and full stops in the wrong places. A page can
; start and stop anywhere, so its first characters are judged as if anything came before them.
; Generated by tools/build_text_plugins.py (a machine over the characters, made deterministic).
id        babel-punctuation
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   babel29
describe  Commas and full stops where sentences put them (babel29 pages).

states    11
start     0
accept    0..10
t 0 " " 1
t 0 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 0 "," 3
t 0 "." 4
t 1 " " 1
t 1 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 2 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 2 "," 3
t 2 " " 5
t 2 "." 6
t 3 " " 5
t 4 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 4 " " 7
t 4 "." 8
t 5 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 5 " " 5
t 6 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 6 " " 7
t 6 "." 9
t 7 "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" 2
t 7 " " 7
t 8 " " 7
t 8 "." 10
t 9 " " 7
t 9 "." 10
t 10 " " 7
end
